    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "skills and resilience don't really matter when the reality is that i'm starting from zero at an age where i should be reaping the rewards. it feels like a bad investment. i put everything i had into this and the return was zero. it just feels like the game is rigged and i'm just done playing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
