      "content": "it just feels so futile though. like what is the point of building a foundation just to stand on it alone in the dark? i've spent my whole life playing by the rules and it led me here. i'm just so tired of trying to fix something that was never meant to work. sometimes i think the only logical thing left to do when you've lost everything is to just stop.",
